&lt;p&gt;Remote, occasionally Zurich · 80–100% · Start as soon as possible ·&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Xebia&lt;/strong&gt; pushes the boundaries of what’s possible – and you’re right in the middle of it! We’re not just consultants, but visionaries: with more than 5,000 experts worldwide, we help our clients drive their digital transformation with passion and ambition. At Xebia, it’s about more than recommendations: with innovative solutions, we create a unique combination of technology, people and processes. Our goal is to make our clients digital frontrunners – ready to turn media usage data into insights that make a difference?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our client, a large Swiss media company, is building a new platform on Azure Databricks for the usage data of its apps and websites. It will replace the commercial analytics tool they use today. Analysts are starting to work on the new platform now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You join the platform team of five developers through Xebia. Most of your time goes into implementing Jira tickets. You build and run the pipelines that take event data from Azure Event Hubs through the bronze, silver and gold layers into the tables analysts and dashboards use. You keep the Databricks and Azure infrastructure in code with Pulumi and ship changes through GitHub Actions. The team creates and refines tickets together and reviews each other&#39;s code. You&#39;ll also help analysts get started with Databricks and GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the senior person in the team, you can advise on anything from implementation details to the overall architecture, while the product owner sets the priorities. Today the role also covers the data model, the infrastructure and the platform costs, and there is room to take on more responsibility over time. The team uses AI coding assistants such as Claude in its daily work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Several years of hands-on data engineering on Databricks: building and running production pipelines with Spark, PySpark or SQL and Delta Lake, in a medallion architecture&lt;br&gt;• Architecture experience on a Databricks or Azure data platform&lt;br&gt;• Streaming or event ingestion, ideally Azure Event Hubs or Kafka&lt;br&gt;• Data modelling for analytics and BI&lt;br&gt;• Infrastructure as code, ideally Pulumi (Terraform experience transfers)&lt;br&gt;• Git, GitHub workflows and CI/CD with GitHub Actions&lt;br&gt;• Experience in larger projects&lt;br&gt;• You work well in a team and get productive with little onboarding&lt;br&gt;• Comfortable using AI coding assistants&lt;br&gt;• Fluent English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Unity Catalog, Databricks Asset Bundles, data quality frameworks&lt;br&gt;• Dashboards in Databricks or Power BI&lt;br&gt;• Azure experience beyond Databricks&lt;br&gt;• Web and app usage tracking or digital analytics, including tracking migrations&lt;br&gt;• Media or broadcasting experience&lt;br&gt;• German&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The current engineer can hand over until the end of January. English is the working language; German is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes us special&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Innovation potential:&lt;/strong&gt; At Xebia, the focus is on innovation and pioneering spirit. You can develop your creative ideas and share innovative thoughts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;Personal growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We believe in personal development for outstanding professional experiences. Unlock your potential and keep growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Community and networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Xebia is a community of technology enthusiasts. Meet professionals from different fields, share knowledge and shape innovation together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⚖️ &lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We value work-life balance. Adapt your working hours and find a balance between your career and your personal life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎉 &lt;strong&gt;Great social events:&lt;/strong&gt; Ski days, B2run, spontaneous after-work apéros, Christmas and summer parties – we celebrate together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to take your professional journey further, we warmly welcome you to Xebia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to meeting you!&lt;/p&gt;
